# The repair probe waits for every member of each asked configuration
# instead of a Phase-1 quorum of qualifying answers: one member down for
# good blocks a lost slot that a quorum could decide. The audit's
# `blocked_in_asked` asks for a quorum, so it must not excuse the journal.
excuse: loss: blocked in asked
file: crates/lib/paros-core/src/proposer.rs
--- find
        .all(|config| config.has_phase1_quorum(&qualifying))
--- replace
        .all(|config| config.members().iter().all(|m| qualifying.contains(m)))
--- end
